example.paragraph:
Let $Q(\textbf{x}) = x_{1}^{2} - 8x_{1}x_{2} - 5x_{2}^{2}$. Compute the value of $Q(\textbf{x})$ for $\textbf{x} = \left\lbrack \begin{array}{r}
        {- 3} \\
        1
        \end{array} \right\rbrack$, $\left\lbrack \begin{array}{r}
        2 \\
        {- 2}
        \end{array} \right\rbrack$, and $\left\lbrack \begin{array}{r}
        1 \\
        {- 3}
        \end{array} \right\rbrack$.

Let $P = \text{[}\begin{matrix}
        \textbf{u}_{1} & \textbf{u}_{2}
